{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-openbao-2026-115364","published":"2026-10-29T08:54:43.281Z","modified":"2026-10-29T10:55:45.595393385Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-115364","GHSA-8gmq-wv9h-fcwp"],"summary":"OpenBao before 2.6.3 Missing Header Check on Agent/Proxy Quit Endpoints","details":"OpenBao before 2.6.3 contains a missing authorization check that allows attackers to stop Agent and Proxy services by omitting the X-Vault-Header. When require_request_header is enabled, attackers can send requests via server-side request forgery to /agent/v1/quit or /proxy/v1/quit to shut down these services.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"openbao","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/openbao"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.6.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/openbao/BIT-openbao-2026-115364.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/openbao/openbao/security/advisories/GHSA-8gmq-wv9h-fcwp"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-115364"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openbao-before-2.6.3-missing-header-check-on-agent-proxy-quit-endpoints"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:openbao:openbao:*:*:*:*:*:go:*:*"],"severity":"Low"}}